WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:05.381
Modulation moves parameters for you, so the picture keeps changing on its own.

2
00:00:05.381 --> 00:00:07.062
Open the Modulation section.

3
00:00:07.519 --> 00:00:10.412
Generators mode has four function generators.

4
00:00:10.412 --> 00:00:13.370
Each one is a source, a target, and an amount.

5
00:00:13.956 --> 00:00:16.638
Slot one's source is already a sine wave.

6
00:00:16.638 --> 00:00:18.274
Set its target to Z Push.

7
00:00:18.726 --> 00:00:20.072
Switch the slot on.

8
00:00:20.525 --> 00:00:22.092
Amount is how far it swings.

9
00:00:22.092 --> 00:00:24.611
Turn it up, and the raster starts to breathe.

10
00:00:25.066 --> 00:00:26.840
Expand the slot for more.

11
00:00:26.840 --> 00:00:30.035
Rate sets how fast the wave cycles, in hertz.

12
00:00:30.760 --> 00:00:35.195
This slot also appears in the Patch Bay as Function Generator one.

13
00:00:35.195 --> 00:00:36.472
Next: the Timeline.
